# The example workspace's showcase drawing: Guide/Whiteboard embeds Volcano Venn.canvas, and the
# whiteboard draws its placed shapes bound to the workspace's notes: a Venn of the volcanoes
# that erupted and the stratovolcanoes, a card on Krakatoa, a sticky with a task, an arrow, and
# the field season's checklist.
size 140x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace
keys p whitebo
wait-for Whiteboard
keys enter
wait-for Volcano Venn: placed shapes
expect ⧉ Volcano Venn.canvas
keys esc
wait-gone reading · Esc / q back
keys w
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type venn
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Volcano Venn · 5 cards · 0 arrows
wait-for Stratovolcanoes
expect-in 10 20 10 60 Erupted
expect-in 22 5 22 30 Krakatoa
expect-in 22 30 22 55 Mount St. Helens
expect-in 22 55 22 75 Mount Fuji
expect-in 7 87 7 120 Krakatoa
expect-in 10 87 10 125 A volcanic island in Indonesia
expect-in 20 87 20 125 Ash masks - [ ] Two per
expect-in 28 87 28 135 Field season
expect-in 32 87 36 135 Pack the gas masks
keys q
wait-for ? help  q quit
keys q
exits 0
